"""The Lambo Index: the curated catalogue of every Lamborghini automobile.

One row per car or significant variant. Facts are curated by hand; photos are
looked up on Wikimedia Commons by tools/images.py using the category names here.

Fields: id, family, name, kind, year, end, body, engine, eng, cv, units, designer,
        commons categories, Wikipedia article, note
  kind  : Production | Limited series | One-off | Concept | Prototype | Race car
  year  : first shown or first produced; end: last year built (0 = still built,
          None = single year / not applicable)
  eng   : engine family used for filtering
  cv    : maximum output in metric horsepower (CV/PS), None when not published
  units : number built, None when not reliably known
Scope: Lamborghini automobiles, including coachbuilt and design-house cars made on
Lamborghini mechanicals. Lamborghini Trattori tractors and boats are separate firms.
"""

G = "Marcello Gandini (Bertone)"
T = "Carrozzeria Touring"
DONCK = "Luc Donckerwolke"
